WEBVTT

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:17.120
Listen, everyone!

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:20.080
I've made up my mind
to go to Delsgade!

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:23.410
Will you be all right?

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:24.960
You're really going, Leno?

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:26.540
Are you coming back?
Or not?

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.790
Don't worry!
I'll be coming back, all ri—

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:32.630
Tithi!

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:36.050
- Here he comes.
- Here he comes.

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:37.640
The scary god!

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:39.260
He's here!

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:42.980
Oh, I've been looking for you,
Great Spirit Mother Leno.

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:44.230
Who are you?

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:47.350
I am the Heavenly Father God, NousGalia.

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:49.320
The father of all gods.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:52.070
I come with good news for you today.

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:56.280
I'd like to create a new Child of God.

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:58.950
And your womb has been chosen
for that child.

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:01.490
Sorry, but I decline.

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:04.500
This was decided by a god.

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:08.500
You may be a member of the God clan,
but I won't let you have your way here!

00:01:11.090 --> 00:01:14.590
Do as I say, order.
A god's order is absolute.

00:01:18.430 --> 00:01:21.760
And now I'm going to impregnate you
with a divine child.

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:29.810
Jio Graze.

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:36.240
Subside, sinister flames!

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:39.570
Demon King Anos!

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:43.290
Ah, so you're the Demon King of Tyranny?

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:44.330
I'm glad you're here.

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:47.960
God has decided on the destruction
of the Demon King of Tyranny.

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:51.630
We will soon see an order
in which I shall kill you.

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:55.550
I see. However,
you will die before that.

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:57.300
Degzegd.

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:01.050
You cannot kill a god!

00:02:01.930 --> 00:02:03.470
That is order!

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:07.810
Subside, sinister curse.
A god's words—

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:13.190
A voice seized by the Looting Sword
can never be recovered.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:16.490
Time for you to record this into
your so-called order.

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:19.860
That even the Laws of the Gods
will be wiped out before me.

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:27.580
Now, then, Great Spirit Mother.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.460
I've come to hear your answer.

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:30.500
Have you reached a decision?

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:35.250
I'm going to place my trust in you.

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:38.420
Then let me provide you with protection.

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:39.220
Shin.

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:42.180
As we agreed,
I'm entrusting her to you.

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:45.640
She's our guest.
Try to obey her as much as you can.

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:46.140
As you wish.

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:50.020
What? Wait, I don't need such
a scary-looking bodyguard!

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:54.110
Because of the barrier along the road to Delzogade,
you can't use Gatom to travel.

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:57.070
Not to mention,
gods don't die as easily as you think.

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:58.570
He might come after you again.

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:03.620
- Um...
- Yes?

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:05.330
What do we do now?

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:08.080
I have been ordered
to do your bidding.

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:10.830
Then I'm telling you,
I really don't need a bodyguard!

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:12.170
Understood.

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:15.960
If you wish me to take my own life—

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:17.960
N-No, that's not what I meant!

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:19.800
If I should go against my lord's orders...

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:22.130
Then I cannot allow myself to live on in shame.

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:26.100
All right! I hear you,
so just settle down, okay?

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:27.720
Understood.

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:34.120
Isolate all the species from one another,
and snuff out the spark of war.

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:37.000
Put up walls between the Infernal Realm,
the Human Realm, the Spirit Realm,

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:39.300
and the Heavenly Realm,

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:41.960
and install a door that won't open
for at least 1,000 years.

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:44.840
If I were to convert all my life
into Magic Power,

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:46.970
and join forces with all of you,

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.470
we could then activate
an immense magic spell.

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:52.930
Fine. I'm going to put my trust in you.

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:54.770
All right, let's get started.

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:29.550
What is it?

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:32.390
How far are you going to escort me, Shin?

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:33.680
Until we're out of the barrier?

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:38.350
My lord has commanded me
to protect you until you reach Aharthern.

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:41.820
I see! Then we still have a little ways to go!

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:47.400
I'm home!

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:49.820
Tithi! I brought you something!

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:54.040
Bad news! Bad news!

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:54.750
What's wrong?

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:56.660
The spirits are being devoured!

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:58.830
The forest's about to dry up!

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:01.920
Divine Beast Gwen!

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:03.000
I'm so scared!

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:04.130
We're surrounded!

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:05.260
We're going to get eaten!

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:08.970
Please step back.

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:16.560
Who's that over there?

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:18.810
This is the Great Spirit Forest.

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:21.360
You can't hide from me!

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:24.150
I'm not hostile.

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:26.900
Allow me to show myself now.

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:28.990
Who are you?

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:33.370
My name is Anoshu.

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:35.950
Anoshu Polticoal.

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:49.470
01 - A LESSON BY GOD

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:53.930
Good morning...

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:55.850
Lord Anos!

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:57.020
And a fine morning it is.

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:57.680
Yes!

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:01.480
Morning, Anos!

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:02.350
Morning.

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:05.610
Wh-What is it?

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:08.030
Those are new hair ribbons.

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:09.780
I'm surprised that you noticed.

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:11.530
Even though they're the same ones?

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:14.830
My eyesight isn't so clouded
that I wouldn't notice a subject's equipment.

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:18.200
Would you mind not calling them equipment?

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:20.710
Sasha's embarrassed because you spotted them.

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:21.750
Huh?

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:23.080
- Is that right?
- Uh...

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:25.750
Don't go putting ideas in his head, Misha!

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:29.630
They're made of silk.
But not just any silk.

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:33.720
It's Twilight Silk that can only be produced
at dusk by Twilight Silk Moths.

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:36.560
Sturdy, and conductive to Fortification Magic.

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:39.770
Though the magical dye is from this era,
it's not bad.

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:42.730
Overall, I'd put them at the bottom of the middle tier.

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:45.650
Misha?

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:47.610
Being too observant isn't really a good thing.

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:49.440
Really?

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:51.700
But I thought it would make her happy.

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:52.740
Hey!

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:54.320
Morning, everyone.

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:55.620
Good morning!

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:59.500
So, you're finally showing up together
in broad daylight!

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:02.250
What? N-No, it's not what it looks like!

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:04.250
We just happened to run into each other,
that's all!

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:05.460
Oh?

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:07.000
A likely story!

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:08.710
I'm sure it was no accident!

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:11.420
Come to think of it, when we were all
hanging out the other day,

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:13.680
didn't we hear that you two snuck out early?

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:15.390
Oh!

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:17.180
So what happened?

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:20.640
N-Nothing at all!

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:26.310
Hey.

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:32.240
Huh. That hybrid should've gotten caught up
in the war and died.

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:36.030
Well, we're not gonna let that misfit lord
it over us anymore.

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:38.830
Right. Now that the founding ancestor's back!

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:41.330
Morning, class!

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:44.330
Before we get started,
I have an announcement to make.

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:47.960
Let me introduce an exchange student
from the Hero Academy.

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:54.930
I'm Eleonore Bianca.
And this one is...

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:57.180
Go on.
Can you tell them your name?

00:08:57.180 --> 00:09:00.470
Zethia... I'm... Zethia Bianca.

00:09:00.760 --> 00:09:02.520
All right, please take your seats now.

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:03.350
Yes.

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:06.850
From the Hero Academy?

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:09.150
After Azeshion tried to provoke a war with us?

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:11.400
I understand your displeasure, class.

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:14.780
But that was a plot devised by Diego.

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:18.990
It's not as if all Humans were turning
on the Demon Race.

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:22.240
Hey, so you're here as exchange students?

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:24.580
Yes. It's all thanks to Anos.

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:26.170
Nice to meet you!

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:28.750
And now here's one more person
to introduce to you.

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:36.220
This is Erdomaid DittiJohn, who'll be
your homeroom teacher starting today.

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:39.720
Huh, an incompetent instructor
who's not even from Royalty?

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:44.060
Where does a lowly Demon get off thinking he
can teach Royalty of noble blood?

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:46.560
All right, settle down now.

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:50.310
Mr. DittiJohn is a demon who was born before
the Seven Elder Demon Emperors,

00:09:50.310 --> 00:09:51.820
and a member of the Four Evil Royals.

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:54.490
What? You mean "the" Four Evil Royals?

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:58.660
Right. The four who commanded a force second only
to the Demon King of Tyranny

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:00.240
in the Demon Realm 2,000 years ago.

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:03.080
The King of Curses, the Scarlet Monument King,
the King of the Netherworld,

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:07.160
and the Blaze Death King... the name
by which Mr. Erdomaid DittiJohn was known.

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:12.460
Let me enlighten you, ignorant ones
who know nothing about 2,000 years ago.

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:16.590
I'll start with the fake Demon King,
Avos Dilhevia.

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:18.340
What did you say?

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:20.180
You dare malign the name
of the Demon King of Tyranny?

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:23.850
You all blindly believe in the name
of a sham Demon King.

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:27.480
Despite the fact that he's seated right there,
reincarnated.

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:29.560
Demon King Anos Voldigoad.

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:35.070
Stop teaching us random lies!

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:40.070
Avos Dilhevia is a spurious name concocted
to mislead Azeshion,

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:43.620
which tried to annihilate
the Demon King after he'd reincarnated.

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:49.500
But now that the ringleader is no more,
there's no need to conceal the true Demon King.

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:54.710
The signers of this Zecht have validated this as fact.

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:57.970
Hey, hold up.
The Seven Elder Demon Emperors...

00:10:57.970 --> 00:10:59.470
It's all seven of them!

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:02.180
Anos Voldigoad, step up here.

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:04.510
You are all...

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:06.640
...in the presence of the Demon King.

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:13.860
Wh-What's going on?

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:15.520
My body's moving on its own!

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:16.900
A word, please.

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:19.280
Hmm, let's see.

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:25.910
Grab a seat.

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:29.040
Dilhade is at peace now.

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:32.250
There's no longer any need
for a Demon King of Tyranny.

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:37.050
Acknowledge me if you want.
And if not, that's fine by me.

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:39.760
I'm no different than any ordinary Demon.

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:43.640
There's nothing noble about power,
nor about blood.

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:46.810
If anything,
you'd find it within your own soul.

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:49.390
So that's what you need to polish.

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:51.810
Agonize, waver, struggle.

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:56.400
Nobility isn't some cheap thing you can attain
by resting on your laurels.

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:58.440
Yes, Lord Anos!

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:04.620
All right, let's get this class started.

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:07.330
Thank you so much, Mr. Erdomaid.

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:11.620
What a lame disguise,
Heavenly Father God NousGalia.

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:17.000
So what would a god who's taken over
a Demon's body be doing here?

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:19.630
Kindly take your seat,
Demon King of Tyranny.

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:22.720
I'll be happy to instruct you personally.

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:26.930
Fine, then. I don't mind hearing what
you have to say.

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:30.770
There is a proper order in this world.

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:32.940
That is the logic of this world.

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:35.650
Why flames are hot,
why objects fall,

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:37.900
even why humans are able
to stand on this earth...

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:39.400
these are all due to order.

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:45.160
And the entities who maintain this order
are embodied as gods.

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:48.740
During the Mythical Age,
all life forms were on the brink of death,

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:50.410
and the world was a wild place.

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:54.460
And this was all caused by
the Goddess of Destruction, Abernyu.

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:56.540
In order to halt the world's devastation,

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:58.710
the Demon King of Tyranny battled this goddess...

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:00.750
and seized her power of annihilation.

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:05.430
The Goddess of Destruction fell to earth,
and the Demon King changed her name.

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:08.350
That would be the Demon Palace Delsgade.

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:11.350
The Goddess of Destruction's power
was transformed into a spell...

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:13.560
...called the Magic Sword of Destruction Venuzdnor.

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:16.730
As a result, those who should
have perished ended up surviving,

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:18.980
and without destruction,
there was no creation,

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:21.610
and neither was there the creation
of any new order.

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:25.320
At this rate,
the order of the world would only be disrupted.

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:28.370
Therefore, the gods decided
to create a new order

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:30.910
to destroy the Demon King of Tyranny.

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:34.790
The gods?
Come on, it's not a fairy tale.

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:38.250
Let me explain it to you,
ignorant ones.

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:42.170
I am the Heavenly Father God, NousGalia.

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:44.510
The order which creates gods.

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:47.010
Mr. Erdomaid is a god?

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:49.090
I thought he was a Demon
from 2,000 years ago?

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:51.220
Huh! Can you believe this pack of lies?

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:52.470
Exactly!

00:13:52.770 --> 00:13:53.890
Can't breathe...

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:55.770
Help...

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:57.020
Let go of your hostility.

00:13:57.350 --> 00:14:01.070
Nothing will happen to you as long
as you have no intent to harm him.

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:02.780
O Demon King of Tyranny.

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:05.280
The order that will destroy you...

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:07.150
is the new Child of God!

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:09.410
And they are here in this academy!

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:13.410
That's quite thoughtful of you to point out,
but what are you scheming?

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:17.540
To restore absolute order to this world.

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:21.880
Let these people go. It's not as if
you'll benefit from killing them.

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:26.340
It's logical that they die.
Nothing can change that.

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:28.300
Hmm... is that so?

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:35.020
Do you wish to try?

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:40.770
True, the Magic Sword of Destruction is capable
of destroying me along with all logic.

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:45.480
But should you kill me, the Heavenly Father God,
this world, too, will fall apart.

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:50.070
Since you so love this world,
that's precisely why you cannot destroy—

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:53.450
Wh-Why...?

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:58.330
You thought you'd get off the hook
if you used the world as your shield?

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:05.460
Agronemt.

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:09.630
What's this?

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:13.100
My power... my divine source?

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:15.180
I did leave you with ten percent.

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:20.640
Since it would truly wipe out the world
if I left you completely unable to revive.

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:22.480
How is that possible?

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:25.150
I couldn't have done it 2,000 years ago.

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:28.070
But now that I've reincarnated myself
into the peaceful era,

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:30.950
I, too, have learned something called restraint.

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:34.580
Now behave yourself for a while.

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:37.410
Carry on with class while I watch over you.

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:46.300
That was surprising, the way the instructor
showed up out of the blue.

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:47.670
I mean...

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:51.300
How can he just go on teaching
like nothing happened after Anos slashed him?

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:54.050
The gods have different values than we do.

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:56.060
Their actions are based on order, see.

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:57.930
Even still...

00:15:57.930 --> 00:16:03.650
But how does teaching at the Demon King Academy
help maintain order?

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:07.320
The gods always keep their promises.
With humans and demons.

00:16:07.530 --> 00:16:13.570
I don't know what he's after, but he might
have promised someone to teach class here.

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:17.280
He said that a new Child of God
was right here at this school, didn't he?

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:22.460
Meaning that the vessel of the Child of God is here,
and is about to awaken, I suppose.

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:25.460
If he's talking about a god who'll destroy you, Anos...

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:28.460
Then it's safe to say that he'll
be born with that much magical power.

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:38.220
Please. All I have to do is find this Child of God,
and put him in his place.

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:39.560
How should we look for him?

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:42.520
Can't you find him
with your Demonic Eyes, Anos?

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:45.810
If the Child of God doesn't exist yet,
that won't work.

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:48.860
Maybe dig into the backgrounds
of all the students and teachers?

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:50.730
Or we could ask around, I guess?

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:53.650
All right, we should probably split up for this.

00:16:53.650 --> 00:16:56.700
Hmm... I need to talk to Melheis.

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:59.330
I'm also going to have him look into
this Child of God.

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:01.250
We'll do some asking around.

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:02.370
I'm counting on you.

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:05.460
First off,
let's split up into three groups.

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:07.920
Eleonore.

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:10.880
Sorry. Could you get started without me?

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:13.340
Fine. Come on, Misha.

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:14.220
Okay.

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:15.930
Where should we start our search?

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:19.560
I'd say the transfer students,
and anyone who just arrived here.

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:23.060
Hi! What's going on, Ledriano?

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:24.940
Where are you right now?

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:27.230
What? The Demon King Academy.

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:29.110
Are you in Dilhade, by any chance?

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:33.280
Yes. Actually, I've discovered a troublesome spell.

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:35.950
Probably something that Jerga left behind.

00:17:43.950 --> 00:17:45.250
So far, nothing.

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:48.380
Not a single lead linking
to the Child of God.

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:50.090
Same here.

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:54.220
The Child of God has nothing to do
with what happened 2,000 years ago, right?

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:55.930
Well... I'm not sure about that.

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:59.090
NousGalia is a god who helped Jerga.

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:01.350
To transform his source into magic.

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:04.480
Do you think there'll be danger of some kind again?

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:08.980
Don't worry.
You and your friends...

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:13.690
Protecting the people of this peaceful era
is a Hero's... it's my mission.

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:14.990
Lay...

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:18.450
I can't allow you to get entangled
in the ravages of the war of that era...

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:22.200
When you have nothing to do
with that battle 2,000 years ago.

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:26.830
Misa?

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:29.080
Then...

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:31.880
I'll protect your peace,
Lay, all right?

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:36.670
I mean... not that I have any power to speak of!

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:38.800
But I can fight by your side, at least!

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:41.890
Even if things go sideways
and you could die?

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:46.770
The person I love might die!
Why would I be afraid of my own death?

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:51.730
More than the peace we have now,
more than bliss in my next life,

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:55.320
what I want is a path
that I can walk down with you, Lay.

00:18:55.990 --> 00:18:59.110
And that's rather cold, you know,
saying I have nothing to do with it.

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:02.160
The Hero from 2,000 years ago,
and who you are now...

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:03.370
You're both the same Lay.

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:10.750
If I were shouldering a heavy fate
like you and Lord Anos,

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:13.920
would you still say that I
had nothing to do with you?

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:19.510
I'll help you, no matter what.
No matter where you are, I'll come to your rescue.

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:21.760
I feel the same way.

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:24.220
Misa...

00:19:35.570 --> 00:19:37.690
Not very classy, peeping like that.

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:40.820
Pardon me.

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:43.780
My name is Gerad Azrema.

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:48.540
Lady Misa Ilioroagu, I have come here
on orders from your father.

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:54.130
What? You're holding a ceremony
for the Second Coming of the Demon King?

00:19:54.340 --> 00:19:58.460
Right, to spread word across Dilhade that
the Demon King has been reincarnated.

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:03.390
And I'd like you all
to sing when it happens.

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:04.390
What?

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:06.510
But shouldn't it be a real choir?

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:10.180
This ceremony will be all about
the start of a new Dilhade,

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:12.650
in which the Royals
and the hybrids stand hand-in-hand.

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:18.820
What I need is a brand new gust of wind that
will smash through all this rigid bloodline supremacism.

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:22.990
No one can sing a song like that but you.

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:24.620
It's what I want to hear.

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:27.870
You know, your melodies, so peaceful
it leaves you at a loss for words.

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:29.330
Yes, sir! Lord Anos!

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:32.410
All righty!
Let's start rehearsing!

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:33.920
- Yeah!
- Anos!

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:34.580
What is it?

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:37.090
Apparently, Revest and the others have been attacked.

00:20:37.090 --> 00:20:38.880
Misha's healing them right now!

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:40.380
Are you all right?

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:44.970
Don't worry about me.
Ms. Menou's been... kidnapped...

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:46.100
Ms. Menou?

00:20:46.100 --> 00:20:47.300
By whom?

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:50.930
The Age of Chaos... Rinka Theornes.

00:20:51.230 --> 00:20:55.600
I cast an Enoy spell on her.
You should be able to track her.

00:20:57.360 --> 00:20:58.020
Anos.

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:01.150
They might as well be saying,
"Please capture us,"

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:02.280
but could it be a diversionary tactic?

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:04.240
We'll go.

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:07.280
You're likely facing a demon
from 2,000 years ago.

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:08.160
It's fine.

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:11.200
Who do you think we've been trained by?
See you!

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:22.510
Looks like you were a step too late,
Demon King Anos.

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:24.260
Ingal.

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:25.630
I won't let you revive him!

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:28.600
Rivide.

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:32.680
You're a demon from 2,000 years ago, eh?

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:35.270
I serve Erdomaid,
the Blaze Death King.

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:37.650
I am Zeik Ozma,
the Blaze Death King's military adviser.

00:21:37.860 --> 00:21:42.480
Erdomaid's? Are you aware that his body's been possessed?

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:48.620
Of course. My lord has deliberately entrusted
his body to the gods to create your enemy.

00:21:48.820 --> 00:21:51.790
That sounds like something he would do. So?

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:55.580
My powers are no match against yours.

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:58.210
Therefore, I would like to challenge your wits.

00:22:03.130 --> 00:22:04.670
Half of a Magic Sword...

00:22:07.640 --> 00:22:10.100
Is that the same one
that my father gave me?

00:22:12.390 --> 00:22:20.020
I've been ordered by my lord, the King
of Curses, Kyhilam Jiste, to take your source.

00:22:22.860 --> 00:22:24.900
You guys! What's happening?

00:22:25.690 --> 00:22:27.780
Blue faces...

00:22:30.030 --> 00:22:33.660
I had them ingest a bit of poison!

00:22:33.660 --> 00:22:34.410
Who are you?

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:41.090
I'm Zabro Gaze. The Scarlet Monument King
Gilysiris Dello's lieutenant.

00:22:45.210 --> 00:22:47.380
Are we done playing tag?

00:22:47.380 --> 00:22:49.220
What are you going to do with Ms. Menou?

00:22:49.430 --> 00:22:51.850
She was a tool for luring you in.

00:22:51.850 --> 00:22:52.850
I have no more use for her.

00:22:55.270 --> 00:22:58.060
I serve the King of the Netherworld, Eges Code.

00:22:58.060 --> 00:22:59.810
Rinka Theornes.

00:22:59.810 --> 00:23:03.020
Following my lord's orders,
I will annihilate you two.

00:23:04.570 --> 00:23:08.450
Hmm. So the Four Evil Royals
have formed an alliance?

00:23:08.450 --> 00:23:10.990
You are searching for the Child of God.

00:23:11.280 --> 00:23:15.080
A wise Demon King Anos
would soon realize the true identity...

00:23:15.080 --> 00:23:17.710
...of the one who has the potential
to become the Child of God.

00:23:17.960 --> 00:23:22.130
In other words, there's a divine vessel
among my subordinates?

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:25.130
My bargaining chip
is the information I possess.

00:23:25.130 --> 00:23:27.210
Would you be so kind as to take me on?

00:23:27.210 --> 00:23:28.090
Fine.

00:23:28.470 --> 00:23:31.890
After all, you've gone out of your way
to challenge me in this peaceful world.

00:23:31.890 --> 00:23:34.970
I hope you're as prepared as you should be.

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:39.980
THE DEMON KING'S DUEL OF INTELLECT

00:23:36.720 --> 00:23:39.690
The Demon King's Duel of Intellect.
